dividuais.\nElevador privativo com acesso por senha.\nFace norte e ventilação cruzada.\nAmbientes sociais amplos e integrados.\nApenas um apartamento por andar.\n\nO condomínio oferece monitoramento por câmeras, portaria presencial até as 22h, acesso eletrônico no período noturno e salão de festas em fase de reforma.\n\nUma excelente opção para quem procura a amplitude dos apartamentos tradicionais, com privacidade, conforto e localização privilegiada, próximo ao Graciosa Country Club.\nAgende sua visita com a MARAGNA Imóveis Selecionados e descubra todos os detalhes deste imóvel 🏠","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/697c6366-fe3b-43f9-8a94-16adb961f811.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b7d2cdee-845f-470e-b3db-4d82fe180432.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3f342f1c-5727-4d1b-9574-606a716b6725.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6348ea73-32ad-4679-84bf-0e0a20f59f53.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c124871f-5e54-4299-8848-f1fb6ef021be.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5d20e018-c372-4d24-8b82-bb789a3bac95.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4d3b25ab-3f97-489d-91c1-3636331096a6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c6b643cc-b17b-4491-aacc-c6cefee7c148.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc614b61cdb9398e6d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8a364973-c6c1-44a2-9863-c59d90a08e43.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68db3bdc